        "alt": "Table: 1 cm = 10 mm, 1 m = 100 cm, 1 km = 1,000 m, 1 kg = 1,000 g, 1 l = 1,000 ml."
      }
    },
    {
      "say": "To change to a smaller unit, multiply.",
      "show": "3 m = 3 × 100 = 300 cm"
    },
    {
      "say": "To change to a bigger unit, divide.",
